      <title>April Jeppson: The value of time — what do we make of it?</title>
      <link>https://www.albertleatribune.com/opinion/april-jeppson-the-value-of-time-what-do-we-make-of-it-54716275</link>
      <description>It is easy to get bogged down in the day-to-day. We stress about all the things — the car making a funny noise, the meeting that ran too long or the never-ending pile of laundry. We spend so much time worrying or stressing that we often forget to look at what’s right in front of us.</description>
